From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:45:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament-view: request a transparent Filament swapchain

TRANSLUCENT view blending and a zero-alpha clear are not sufficient when
the swapchain is created with its default opaque configuration. Request the
Filament transparent swapchain so the Wayland subsurface can reveal the
Flutter parent around rendered geometry.

---
 .../filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/view_target.cc
@@ -178,1 +178,1 @@
-  fswapChain_ = _engine->createSwapChain(&native_window_);
+  fswapChain_ = _engine->createSwapChain(&native_window_, filament::SwapChain::CONFIG_TRANSPARENT);
